    "body": "@gterzian does Servo have that model because of the HTML Standard or because it was found necessary studying other implementations / compat?\r\n\r\nThe final comments in #1900 suggest that this \"were triggered\" can be replaced with \"has listeners for\", which we should indeed formalize better, but would be a less invasive change (and rely upon something that while not encouraged, is more widespread in the platform).",
