    "body": "Okay, \"default action\" there triggers alarm bells, as events are not really supposed to have those (other than click's rather elaborate handling in the dispatch algorithm). There's a user action of pressing a key, which ends up triggering the events and should keep track of such details as mentioned in that comment.",
