    "body": "@gterzian It's been a long time since I made that change. `EventDefault` was a hack introduced in servo/servo#14738 and it was specific to `keypress` (and Servo's implementation), because some key presses and mouse events were being sent to the constellation when they shouldn't be (I'm not sure what progress has been made after, but I'm pretty sure it's not from the spec). If it's confusing things, please feel free to revert it back.",
